{"4897700":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Recessive","steam_appid":4897700,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Foundation<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One bedroom, two empty slots, and $1,500. Buy your first rack, stock it from the Steam Community Market or in-game marketplace, and unbox your starters — carefully, because food, cleaning, and upgrades all come out of the same pocket.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/77a50bec1037674463f6be83f2eab396.poster.avif?t=1785834508\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/77a50bec1037674463f6be83f2eab396.webm?t=1785834508\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/77a50bec1037674463f6be83f2eab396.mp4?t=1785834508\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Odds<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A real inheritance engine, true to the hobby — dominants, incomplete dominants and supers, recessives, 50% and 66% possible hets, and hidden carriers you won't know about until they prove out. Run exact outcome percentages in the built-in genetic calculator, study the morph encyclopedia, and plan multi-generation projects that stack genes toward the combo you're chasing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/7e0fcb39e429b1745572c13ad9ebcc2d.poster.avif?t=1785834508\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/7e0fcb39e429b1745572c13ad9ebcc2d.webm?t=1785834508\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/7e0fcb39e429b1745572c13ad9ebcc2d.mp4?t=1785834508\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hatch Your Reward<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two months of incubation until the eggs pip — then you open each one yourself. Did you hit the visual, or another round of hets to prove out with a shed DNA test? Every snake is procedurally drawn from its genes, so no two animals ever look alike — and once in a lifetime, a glowing Shiny worth a fortune. A full family tree records every pairing behind every egg.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/8fc2034cf297ce9f4d70f9bfab361ae9.poster.avif?t=1785834508\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/8fc2034cf297ce9f4d70f9bfab361ae9.webm?t=1785834508\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/8fc2034cf297ce9f4d70f9bfab361ae9.mp4?t=1785834508\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run the Operation<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living animals, daily stakes: feeding, dirty tubs, illness, sheds, old age. Sell on the market, hit cash milestones, automate feeding and cleaning as you scale, and expand from a bedroom hobby into a full breeding facility — while keeping the producers your whole program depends on.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/cc6e371966f3abd5a39b8986ad00b10f.poster.avif?t=1785834508\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/cc6e371966f3abd5a39b8986ad00b10f.webm?t=1785834508\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/cc6e371966f3abd5a39b8986ad00b10f.mp4?t=1785834508\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mint &amp; Trade on Steam<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag a snake you bred to mint it as a real item in your Steam Inventory. It leaves your save for good and becomes a tradeable, marketable asset — and tags are scarce, dropping on a timer, so mint only your best. Trade a starter to a new keeper, list a multi-gene female on the Community Market, or import another breeder's bloodline into your own collection. See how far a line you built by hand can travel.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/134ac218ca530b24928951f3d582f34f.poster.avif?t=1785834508\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4897700\/extras\/134ac218ca530b24928951f3d582f34f.webm?t=1785834508\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.co